tive if her released rotation can reliably activate its passive. Provisional; check released kit."},{"name":"Favonius Greatsword","text":"Provides Energy Recharge and team particles when Danica can CRIT. Reliable support choice. Build CRIT Rate for particle generation."},{"name":"\"Ultimate Overlord's Mega Magic Sword\"","text":"Energy Recharge and ATK make this a practical event weapon for support or hybrid builds. Provisional; check released kit."},{"name":"Blackcliff Slasher","text":"CRIT DMG for Combat Maid, but its kill-based passive is unreliable against bosses. Provisional; check released kit."}],"a":[{"names":["Heart of the Furnace"],"text":"Consider for Guardian Maid only if she can activate the required Stellar reaction and team buff.","stats":"ATK% / ER · provisional"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Supports party ATK after Burst when no other teammate is using this set.","stats":"ATK% / ER · support"},{"names":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"text":"Possible personal damage set if the release kit meets the reaction requirements.","stats":"CRIT / ATK · provisional"}],"t":[{"name":"Royal Protection","members":["Danica","Anastasya","Odette","Mitya"],"text":"Guardian Maid shields Anastasya during her on-field Cryo stance. Danica’s Anchor adds Electro and buffs Conduct; Odette and Mitya support.","roles":["Shield / Buff","Cryo DPS","Glimmer Buff","Electro"]},{"name":"Palace Conduct","members":["Danica","Sandrone","Odette","Yae Miko"],"text":"Sandrone drives Stellar-Conduct while Guardian Maid shields and buffs her. Yae adds Electro hits and Odette strengthens Glimmer.","roles":["Shield / Buff","DPS","Glimmer Buff","Electro DPS"]},{"name":"Cryo Bodyguard","members":["Danica","Wriothesley","Escoffier","Odette"],"text":"Danica’s shield protects Wriothesley while the Anchor supplies Electro. Escoffier heals; Odette supports the reaction.","roles":["Shield / Buff","Cryo DPS","Healer","Glimmer Buff"]},{"name":"Combat Maid","members":["Danica","Anastasya","Odette","Alyosha"],"text":"Danica takes the field in Combat Maid for Electro attacks. Anastasya uses her off-field Crown; Odette and Alyosha support Conduct.","roles":["Electro DPS","Cryo Support","Glimmer Buff","Electro Support"]}],"v":"Guardian Maid · Shield: Use the defensive Anchor for an ATK-scaling shield, off-field Electro and party buffs.\nCombat Maid · DPS: Choose the offensive Anchor for Electro-infused attacks. Cannot run both Anchor modes together.\nNoblesse Support: Use 4-piece Noblesse for a Burst-triggered party ATK buff if no teammate already carries it.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Support / DPS"],"about":"Danica is an Electro claymore user with two reported Anchor modes. Guardian Maid gives an ATK-scaling shield, off-field Electro hits and team buffs. Combat Maid keeps her on field for Electro attacks and Stellar-Conduct damage. Her modes cannot run together. Pre-release kit.","pros":["ATK-based shield","Electro RES shred","Conduct team buffs","On-field damage mode"],"cons":["Modes cannot overlap","Needs Excitement","ATK / ER balancing","Pre-release kit"],"weapons":["Torrents of Spring","Wolf's Gravestone","A Thousand Blazing Suns","Gest of the Mighty Wolf","Blade of Atonement","Favonius Greatsword","\"Ultimate Overlord's Mega Magic Sword\"","Blackcliff Slasher"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Reaction support idea"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Team Burst buff"},{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Combat Maid concept"}],"main":["ATK% / Energy Recharge","ATK% / Electro DMG","ATK% / CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["Shield scaling: ATK% (provisional)","Energy Recharge: Team-dependent","Damage stats: Not confirmed"],"vars":[{"title":"Guardian Maid Shield","role":"Electro Support","weapons":["Torrents of Spring","Wolf's Gravestone","Favonius Greatsword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% for shield strength and reaction buffs; enough ER for Burst. CRIT Rate only if using Favonius.","teams":"An on-field Cryo or Electro attacker; build Excitement before switching Danica in.","when":"Use Entry Skill to enter Guardian Maid, refresh the Anchor, shield the active carry and support Stellar-Conduct.","cond":"Guardian Maid and Combat Maid are mutually exclusive.","notes":"Torrents of Spring adds 16% ATK and boosts active-character Stellar-Conduct damage by 20% or 40% at R1. Pre-release weapon info.","pre":true},{"title":"Combat Maid Electro","role":"On-field Electro DPS","weapons":["Torrents of Spring","A Thousand Blazing Suns","Wolf's Gravestone","Serpent Spine"],"arts":[{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% / Electro DMG / CRIT; meet energy needs. Exact best set is unverified.","teams":"Off-field Cryo for Stellar-Conduct; pre-cast buffs before Danica takes the field.","when":"Stay on field to spend Excitement on repeated special Skills and Electro Anchor attacks, rather than shielding a teammate.","cond":"Only Combat Maid mode; shield support mode is unavailable.","notes":"Torrents of Spring buffs Electro Stellar-Conduct damage and can work off-field. Combat Maid interactions need release testing.","pre":true},{"title":"Noblesse Burst Buffer","role":"Electro Support","weapons":["Favonius Greatsword","\"Ultimate Overlord's Mega Magic Sword\""],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER to Burst consistently, then ATK for shield and buffs; CRIT Rate for Favonius.","teams":"An ATK-scaling carry; another teammate already holds Heart of the Furnace.","when":"Choose Noblesse when a second Furnace set would duplicate the team buff and Danica can Burst in rotation.","cond":"Support setup, not the Combat Maid damage build.","notes":"Pre-release; Burst cadence and buff values may change.","pre":true}],"mats":["Vajrada Amethyst Sliver","Vajrada Amethyst Fragment","Vajrada Amethyst Chunk","Vajrada Amethyst Gemstone","Damaged Flint","Teachings of Glory","Guide to Glory","Philosophies of Glory","Ethereal Glimmershard","Ethereal Crystal","Ethereal Crystalscale Stone","Flockingweed","Twisted Withered Branch","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Not confirmed at release"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level TBD at release"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level TBD at release"}],"teams":[{"name":"Royal Protection","members":["Danica","Anastasya","Odette","Mitya"]},{"name":"Palace Conduct","members":["Danica","Sandrone","Odette","Yae Miko"]},{"name":"Cryo Bodyguard","members":["Danica","Wriothesley","Escoffier","Odette"]},{"name":"Combat Maid","members":["Danica","Anastasya","Odette","Alyosha"]}]},"pv":true}],"title":"Danica","el":"Electro","pv":true}